OL,5,G1200 A Place in the Sun
OL,6,     FRecently retired Baksho wants a
OL,7,     Ffamily-friendly holiday home in
OL,8,     Fthe resort of Gran Alacant on
OL,9,     FSpain's popular Costa Blanca. With
OL,10,     Fa #100k budget, can Jasmine Harman
OL,11,     Ffind the perfect place?
OL,12,G1300 A Place in the Sun
OL,13,     FErica and Ian dream of owning a
OL,14,     Fholiday home on their favourite
OL,15,     FCanary Island of Fuerteventura,
OL,16,     Fwhere they can escape from cold
OL,17,     Fwinters. Lee Juggurnauth shows
OL,18,     Fthem what #170k can buy.
